{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06485","headline":"经陆补阙隐居 · 綦毋潜","name":"经陆补阙隐居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不敢要君徵亦起，致君全得似唐虞。\n谠言昨叹离天听，新象今闻入县图。\n琴锁坏窗风自响，鹤归乔木隐难呼。\n学书弟子何人在，点检犹存谏草无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"綦毋潜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06485.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06485","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}